CharaROM is designed to improve performance, stability, and security over stock Android, while bringing in a wide range of modern features - much like crDroid.

The difference?

We have personality.
We have RestlessOS and GrapheneOS security and privacy enhancements
We have a boot animation changer (thanks, EvolutionX and RisingOS/Rising Revived!)
We have F-Droid Privileged Extension built-in
We have enhanced user choice
We have... mentions of a Chara Fumo? (do those even exist?)

So, what can you expect?
- Vanadium and AOSmium recognized webviews
- Face Unlock, AudioFX, MatLog, and LMODroid Freeform Sidebar are gone
- LibreDNS is a supported Private DNS option
- AntiSafetyCore, F-Droid Privileged Extension, ntfy, OpenKeychain, and an Android Auto Stub are all baked in
- FONTS! We Atkinson Hyperlegible, Determination, Mercy, OpenDyslexic, and Papyrus included.
- Boot Animation Changer! Yes, we know, our default boot animation is simple. So, what do we have? 3 other boot animations, including a meowing cat!
- Flavored remarks. Home Screen and Settings all contain flavored remarks. Whether it be sarcasm, chaos, or quirky references; there's a lot to discover. Just don't get jumpscared by the empty Recents screen...
- A whole lot more planned!

We don't include GApps or MicroG by default, nor will we link any GApps or MicroG package. Use what you feel comfortable with.
